# Design System

Single source of truth for colors and design values: `src/lib/design-system/tokens.ts`.
Full reference: `docs/agent-guides/DESIGN_SYSTEM_REFERENCE.md`.

## Components

Import from `@/lib/design-system/components`:

- `Button` variants: `primary`, `secondary`, `accent`, `ghost`, `outline`, `danger`
- `GradientButton` for hero sections (gradients: `brand`, `green`, `teal`, `purple`, `cosmic`)
- `AIButton` for VIVA features
- `Card` variants: `default`, `elevated`, `outlined`
- Also: `Input`, `Textarea`, `Badge`, `ProgressBar`, `Spinner`, `Container`, `PageLayout`, `Footer`, `Video`, `AreaBar`, `PageHero`
- `AreaBar` is the header for studio areas (Life Vision, Admin, Journal, …). See `rules/STUDIO_PAGE_BUILDING_RULES.md`.
- `PageHero` is a slim left-aligned title row for standalone pages only — never a boxed/gradient hero, never inside a studio layout.

## Brand Colors

- Primary Electric Lime `#39FF14` (growth, alignment, "above the Green Line")
- Secondary Neon Cyan `#00FFFF` (clarity, flow)
- Accent Neon Purple `#BF00FF` (premium, VIVA)
- Energy Neon Yellow `#FFFF00` (celebration, wins)
- Contrast Neon Red `#FF0040` (alerts, "below Green Line")

## Principles

- Buttons: pill-shaped (`rounded-full`), hover lift 2px, 300ms transitions
- Cards: `rounded-2xl`, 2px borders (`#333`), hover lift 4px, `p-8` padding
- Spacing: container `px-6`, sections `mb-12` to `mb-16`, card grids `gap-6` to `gap-8`
